# ## 2. Exercise 1 — `boundary_crossings`: where does data change trust level?
#
# A **trust boundary** is any flow whose two ends are at different trust levels. Two directions matter for
# different reasons. Data moving **up** (from a lower level to a higher one) is how untrusted text reaches
